## Target Identity and Functional Architecture

L'Homme's bright ginger and violet-green tailoring remain the identity. The one controlled axis is vintage magnetic warmth: Ebanol and Azarbre connect transparent cedar to a dry Tonkarome shadow without cardamom darkness, gourmand sweetness, or generic amber mass. The inventory-independent TARGET / IDEAL FORMULA remains separate in `../candidates/LH-02.json`; this table is only the CURRENT-INVENTORY BUILD.

